{%- comment -%}
  Prints 1 when the bag's 10% / 18% spend rewards are switched off: during a sitewide sale
  (snippets/sale-active), or while the Plaayers Club is on (members earn credit instead).
  Free delivery over the threshold stays either way.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture sale_on -%}{%- render 'sale-active' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
